WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,060
I casually went out and sneaked around a few times

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,380
No more food tonight

3
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:08,990
I'm afraid I went out to play cards again.

4
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:10,830
It’s true that dogs can’t change their eating habits.

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,200
He has stopped playing cards recently.

6
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,240
Don't always give people such a bad voice

7
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,440
Then what do you think he did all afternoon?

8
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,960
Then how do I know? Anyway, I think

9
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:24,360
You can't have no evidence

10
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,280
Just go and accuse people wrongly

11
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,280
Then we'll wait and see

12
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:51,440
Written by Qin

13
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,740
I bought the kettle with the ten yuan I had before

14
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,260
When going out to sea, remember to wear it and have food.

15
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,700
Be sure to eat on time
